{"id":"ig_05","book":"ig","bookLabel":"Instagram & YouTube report","title":"YT What Works","tables":[{"cols":["A","L"],"rows":[["What kind of YouTube content works for us","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Every table is live formulas over 'YT Video Log'. Hit rate = share of videos in the group that beat the channel median views for their format (Short or long video). 50% = average; 65%+ = clearly working. Groups with fewer than 5 videos are greyed out.","","","","","","","","","","",""],[],["PLAYBOOK — what to stick to","","","","","","","","","","",""],["SHORTS — HOOKS","Title/hook styles that win: Celebrity face (69% beat median, 26 videos), Humour / meme (67% beat median, 18 videos). Median 'viewed vs swiped' 49%; the top quarter of Shorts sit above 63%.","","","","","","","","","",""],["SHORTS — LENGTH","Hit rate by length: 31–60s 65% (86), 0–30s 62% (73), 61–90s 54% (127), 120s+ 39% (155), 91–120s 36% (84). Aim for 31–60s.","","","","","","","","","",""],["LONG VIDEOS","Median thumbnail CTR 9.1% (YouTube's typical range is 2–10%); median 21% of each episode watched. Most viewers leave in the first 30–60s, so open on the twist, keep the recap short, and end on a cliffhanger that points to the app.","","","","","","","","","",""],["CLIFFHANGERS","Best endings: Promise of payoff / revenge (66% beat median, 35 videos), Named suspect / whodunit (58% beat median, 26 videos). Weakest: Coming soon / release date (38%).","","","","","","","","","",""],["CTA","Best CTAs: Watch on TukTuki (55% beat median, 228 videos). Put the app link and 'Poori series TukTuki app par' in the first two description lines, and pin a comment prompt.","","","","","","","","","",""],["CONTENT MIX","Lean into: Meme / humour (82% beat median, 11 videos), Full episode / long cut (52% beat median, 106 videos).","","","","","","","","","",""],["SHOWS","Strongest YouTube IP: Zinda Hoon Main (100% beat median, 6 videos), Maidam (100% beat median, 4 videos), Life Ka Replay (100% beat median, 7 videos).","","","","","","","","","",""],["SUBSCRIBERS","Top subscriber drivers: Accidental Wife (Video, 1602 subs); Secret Billionaire (Video, 476 subs); Tara Hates Tahir (Video, 191 subs). Long episodes win most subscribers per video; Shorts win reach.","","","","","","","","","",""],["TITLES & SEO","Avg title/description SEO score 4.9/10. Common fixes: show name + hook in the first 60 characters, open the description with a real hook sentence instead of the boilerplate hashtag block, 3–5 relevant hashtags, and the app link up top.","","","","","","","","","",""],[],["By format","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Group","# Videos","Hit rate (beat median)","Avg views","Avg engaged views","Avg ER","Avg hook score","Avg mid-roll score","Avg cliffhanger score","Avg % viewed","Avg subs gained","Avg CTR (long videos)"],["Short","525","50%","429","203","1.5%","5.0","5.0","5.0","41%","0.5",""],["Video","111","50%","15,294","10,534","0.8%","5.0","5.0","5.0","21%","40.4","8.6%"],[],["Shorts — by hook type","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Group","# Videos","Hit rate (beat median)","Avg views","Avg engaged views","Avg ER","Avg hook score","Avg mid-roll score","Avg cliffhanger score","Avg % viewed","Avg subs gained","Avg CTR (long videos)"],["Question / mystery","180","44%","371","165","2.4%","5.0","4.6","5.3","38%","0.4",""],["Conflict / shock reveal","116","53%","426","225","1.3%","6.2","5.0","5.8","38%","0.7",""],["Bold statement","82","41%","363","182","0.9%","4.5","5.2","4.5","44%","0.3",""],["Emotional moment","54","52%","491","237","1.0%","4.8","5.4","5.4","42%","0.6",""],["Celebrity face","26","69%","901","420","1.2%","3.7","4.3","3.4","33%","1.2",""],["Suspect / whodunit","21","57%","451","240","1.0%","5.2","5.4","5.0","45%","0.7",""],["Other","21","67%","509","196","1.2%","4.1","6.5","2.9","55%","0.5",""],["Humour / meme","18","67%","470","155","0.6%","2.7","5.3","2.5","49%","0.3",""],["Festival / topical tie-in","4","25%","143","45","0.9%","3.2","5.6","2.1","40%",